This product includes configuration and integration interfaces for the following
OSI-Approved Open Source Software components (pulled dynamically via container
registries without bundling third-party source code):

1. Keycloak (https://www.keycloak.org/)
   - Role: Tier 1 Unified Identity & SSO (OIDC / OAuth2 / RBAC)
   - License: Apache License 2.0 (OSI-Approved)

2. Traefik Proxy (https://traefik.io/)
   - Role: Tier 1 API Gateway & Zero-Trust Reverse Proxy
   - License: MIT License (OSI-Approved)

3. PostgreSQL (https://www.postgresql.org/)
   - Role: Tier 1 Structured Data Engine (Single Source of Truth)
   - License: PostgreSQL License (OSI-Approved)

4. RustFS (https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs)
   - Role: Tier 1 High-Performance S3-Compatible Object Storage
   - License: Apache License 2.0 (OSI-Approved)

5. Kestra (https://kestra.io/)
   - Role: Tier 1 Declarative Headless Workflow Engine
   - License: Apache License 2.0 (OSI-Approved)

6. DuckDB (https://duckdb.org/)
   - Role: Tier 2 In-Process OLAP Analytics Engine
   - License: MIT License (OSI-Approved)
